	(text "PiFinder4 Buzzer Driver\nMLT-5020 magnetic transducer\nDriven from CM4 GPIO (3.3V logic) via\nAO3400A low-side N-MOSFET switch.\nD1 clamps inductive flyback to +5V rail.\nR2 pull-down keeps buzzer silent\nduring CM4 boot when GPIO floats."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
